      "value": "After double-checking, it seems there are instances where this happens and others where it doesn't.\n\nAlthough I couldn't determine the exact cause of this difference, it appears I'm not the only one experiencing this phenomenon; after speaking with other users, I confirmed that they've encountered similar issues.\n\nI have a video recording of this, but for some reason I couldn’t upload it, so I’m unable to post it. I apologize.",
