  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In worlds and instances where items that affect user movement—such as trampolines—are prohibited, a bug has been occurring where objects that should not be placeable can be placed—but only when placed via the wing menu.\n\nThis makes it effectively impossible to enforce the ban.\n\nSince this bug could cause problems for various worlds and creators, please address it as soon as possible.",
